{"version":"4834cf5b54ec0e0079f4339601d08415","result":{"pages":1,"data":[{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"907","BOARD_NAME":"转基因","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2024年年报显示，子公司甘肃省玉米种业研究院有限公司从事转基因农作物种子生产。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":16,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0907","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0907","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"888","BOARD_NAME":"农业种植","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"公司地处被确定为国家级玉米制种基地的甘肃省,其主打品种先玉335已处于成熟期,推出的先玉508和先玉402等品种区域性优势较强。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":17,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0888","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0888","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"834","BOARD_NAME":"乡村振兴","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"敦煌种业是国家育繁推一体化经营企业、国家级杂交玉米育繁工程实验室、省级高新技术企业、省级杂交玉米技术中心,公司与多个国家和省级科研院所进行合作,是甘肃省战略性新兴产业总体攻坚战骨干企业。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":18,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0834","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0834","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"815","BOARD_NAME":"昨日涨停","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":11,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0815","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0815","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"803","BOARD_NAME":"股权转让","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2024年7月17日晚间,敦煌种业披露公告称,公司控股股东由酒泉市政府国资委变更为酒泉钢铁(集团)有限责任公司(以下简称“酒钢集团”),实际控制人由酒泉市政府国资委变更为甘肃省国资委。","IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":12,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0803","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0803","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"600354.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"600354","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"敦煌种业","BOARD_CODE":"712","BOARD_NAME":"一带一路","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"敦煌种业位于甘肃河西走廊西端的酒泉市,是历史上丝绸之路的必经之地,河西走廊已成为中国第一大种子生产基地,毗邻中